  "description": "A quick note for a stock today 10/14/25",
  "body_html": "<p>Good morning everyone and happy Tuesday. This stock, we originally bought July 31st, and took a small profit. Some people chose to hold and are up ~7%. You all know that I exited many positions back in September…respecting any drastic weakness signals coming along in the broader market. That stock has started to breakout pre-market, hitting key levels that indicate a larger run is coming along. So the big run I was originally aiming for, remains. </p><p>Normally my positions are for subscribers only, but since this was featured on Yahoo, I will share with everyone. </p><p>You can see the original article on why I like Huntington Ingalls, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$HII&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> here:</p><div class=\"digest-post-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;nodeId&quot;:&quot;9699645d-9d6c-4a0e-8653-e07d14cb1844&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;If you don’t know me, I was a Naval Officer for several years…then worked at the Pentagon in the Navy Program Office…and then went to Bath Iron Works and Huntington Ingalls Industries, which are some of the largest Naval Shipbuilding facilities in the United States. The point being: I have a firm grasp on the naval defense sector.&quot;,&quot;cta&quot;:&quot;Read full story&quot;,&quot;showBylines&quot;:true,&quot;showDescription&quot;:true,&quot;showImage&quot;:true,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;lg&quot;,&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Why HII is going to win the next big government contract... and the stock will BOOM&quot;,&quot;publishedBylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:301052325,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Investing • Market Analyst • No Politics • 574,000 on TikTok&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:1000}],&quot;post_date&quot;:&quot;2025-08-05T13:17:35.753Z&quot;,&quot;cover_image&quot;:&quot;https://substack-video.s3.amazonaws.com/video_upload/post/170118381/d970bd21-6960-41a1-86c4-c70e13f64307/transcoded-1754399735.png&quot;,&quot;cover_image_alt&quot;:null,&quot;canonical_url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/why-hii-is-going-to-win-the-next&quot;,&quot;section_name&quot;:null,&quot;video_upload_id&quot;:&quot;d970bd21-6960-41a1-86c4-c70e13f64307&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:170118381,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;podcast&quot;,&quot;reaction_count&quot;:25,&quot;comment_count&quot;:5,&quot;publication_id&quot;:3537822,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLq1!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F96c222d2-04e7-4e47-9e11-4b10f4cee9c4_854x854.png&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;youtube_url&quot;:null,&quot;show_links&quot;:null,&quot;feed_url&quot;:null}\"></div><p><strong>You can also read my <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/community/post/97dfd88d-081b-4828-8f0a-e56aa1d07775/\">Yahoo featured analysis by clicking here</a>.</strong></p><p>I will be purchasing this shortly after market open. Current price is $294.71. </p><p>I will be out this afternoon, so if you have any questions or need anything, tag me in the chat, and I will be happy to answer tomorrow during market hours. Hope you all have a great day, and last but not least….thanks for stopping by! 👍</p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok?utm_source=user-menu\">StockTok Main Page</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Positions</a> |</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><p> </p>",
